# Doc structure

## Layout

doc/design/     # full design (numbered chapters)
doc/roadmaps/   # versioned milestones + phases

## design/

- README.md index + read order
- Chapters: 00-overview … 09-extensibility (zero-padded prefixes)
- Do not put roadmap/version plans under design/

## roadmaps/

- README.md — version index table (version, status, link)
- VERSIONING.md — naming rules only
- Milestone file: m_<major.minor>_<slug>.md  e.g. m_0.1_mvp.md
- Milestone dir:  m_<major.minor>/           e.g. m_0.1/
- Phase file:     m_<ver>/p_<ver>.<n>.md     e.g. m_0.1/p_0.1.1.md

## Required sections

Milestone: goals, phase list, overall acceptance, non-goals, status
Phase: goals, scope, non-goals, tasks, acceptance, depends-on, linked design chapters, status
Status values only: planned | in_progress | done | deferred
